flowchart TD
  IN[Input / trigger] --> PLAN[Planner]
  PLAN --> ACT[Tool executor]
  ACT --> VAL{Schema + sanity valid?}
  VAL -- no --> RETRY[Repair, bounded retries]
  RETRY --> ACT
  VAL -- yes --> MEM[(State)]
  MEM --> DONE{Goal met or budget hit?}
  DONE -- no --> PLAN
  DONE -- yes --> OUT[Result + trace]
